  "$comment": "Campaign level 22 (S4): a balloon archipelago on open sea. Home island west, rival island east with two Skylofts, two Watchtowers, posted guards and no lodges; six high isles between that only balloons reach. The Reliquary isle and the mist seer isle lie within 30 cells of the player Hearth, so the rival never floats worshippers there; the far south isle carries a ley stone and a strong storm ward side by side. Staged: raise a Skyloft (scripted in the bot scenario, the bot has no build objective handling), pray at the near Reliquary (teaches Whirlwind, wakes both ley isles), win the Gale Shrine before the rival balloons do (siteLost, the idle loss at about tick 14950), pray both ley isles and hold them, hold three isle stones for four minutes while raiders land on the north ley and pray it away, then the stones lift a causeway (it runs the short way round the world, over the west edge), unlock the lodges and send a six-warden rival war band over it: kill six rival wardens (the band); three more posted guards fall back to the rival Hearth and the player crosses to raze it (destroy, not eliminateAll); that wakes the Sky Gate isle mid sea, which only balloons reach, and three followers pray there (fromStage worship) to finish. Bot win about 31275, time limit 3300 s.",
